- nazoos-update-label.path/.service: new snapshots get their boot menu
  name at once (zypper from Welcome, Myrlyn, a terminal), not only at
  the next update check; the update itself still renames its pair to
  "Before/After update"
- Boot menu: the backup snapper keeps at a rollback is "Before rollback"
- Notifications 10 s after login with AccuracySec=1s (the timer's
  default accuracy of 1 min made it fire up to a minute late)

